00:08:50,769 --> 00:08:56,769
Spaceship Earth is a documentary film directed by Matt Wolf.

2
00:17:41,538 --> 00:17:47,538
In 1991 a group of countercultural visionaries built an enormous
replica of earth’s ecosystem called Biosphere 2.

3
00:26:32,307 --> 00:26:38,307
When eight “biospherians” lived sealed inside, they faced
ecological calamities and cult accusations.

4
00:35:23,076 --> 00:35:29,076
Their epic adventure is a cautionary tale but also a testament to
the power of small groups reimagining the world.

